      "title": "Tell Someone What Helps",
      "instruction": "Tell one person one concrete thing that makes celiac easier for you.",
      "safety_note": "Support works better when people know what you actually need.",
      "completion_message": "You tried the skill. That counts. +15 XP",
      "source_basis": "Teen lived-experience synthesis",
      "steps": [
        "Maybe a friend can help check restaurants.",
        "Maybe you want people to ask instead of assuming what is safe.",
        "Maybe you want someone not to make a big deal if you decide not to eat.",
        "Choose something that would genuinely help you."
      ],
      "reflection_options": [
        "😊 Easier than expected",
        "🙂 Pretty good",
        "😐 Okay",
        "😬 Awkward",
        "🔄 Didn't go as planned"
      ],
      "source_url": null,
      "review_note": "Keep this challenge flagged for expert review before public release. It translates evidence and/or teen lived experience into a real-world self-management activity."
    },
    "graph": {
      "format": "rlc_branching_v1",
      "start_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_OPEN",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "RLC_008_V2_OPEN",
          "type": "opening",
          "text": "Someone you trust wants to be helpful, but they are not sure what actually makes things easier for you.",
          "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D1"
        },
        {
          "id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_AFTER1",
          "type": "consequence",
          "text": "You give them a concrete planning role.",
          "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D2"
        },
        {
          "id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_AFTER2",
          "type": "consequence",
          "text": "You ask for information and choice rather than assumptions.",
          "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D2"
        },
        {
          "id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_AFTER3",
          "type": "consequence",
          "text": "You explain how they can reduce social pressure.",
          "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D2"
        },
        {
          "id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_AFTER4",
          "type": "consequence",
          "text": "You define support in your own way.",
          "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D2"
        },
        {
          "id": "RLC_008_V2_D1",
          "type": "decision",
          "text": "What would be most useful to tell them?",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_C1",
              "text": "Help me check restaurant options",
              "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_AFTER1"
            },
            {
              "id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_C2",
              "text": "Ask instead of assuming what is okay for me",
              "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_AFTER2"
            },
            {
              "id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_C3",
              "text": "Please don’t make a big deal if I decide not to eat",
              "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_AFTER3"
            },
            {
              "id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_C4",
              "text": "Something else that genuinely helps me",
              "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D1_AFTER4"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "RLC_008_V2_D2_AFTER1",
          "type": "consequence",
          "text": "You make the request easier to understand.",
          "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_END"
        },
        {
          "id": "RLC_008_V2_D2_AFTER2",
          "type": "consequence",
          "text": "One clear request can be enough.",
          "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_END"
        },
        {
          "id": "RLC_008_V2_D2_AFTER3",
          "type": "consequence",
          "text": "You turn support into collaboration.",
          "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_END"
        },
        {
          "id": "RLC_008_V2_D2",
          "type": "decision",
          "text": "They respond, “I didn’t know that.” What next?",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "RLC_008_V2_D2_C1",
              "text": "Tell them one example",
              "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D2_AFTER1"
            },
            {
              "id": "RLC_008_V2_D2_C2",
              "text": "Thank them and leave it there",
              "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D2_AFTER2"
            },
            {
              "id": "RLC_008_V2_D2_C3",
              "text": "Ask what would make it easier for them to help",
              "next_node_id": "RLC_008_V2_D2_AFTER3"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "RLC_008_V2_END",
          "type": "ending",
          "text": "You practiced making support concrete instead of expecting someone to guess what you need.",
          "skill_tags": [
            "SPEAK",
            "COLLABORATE",
            "SAY"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
